    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Machine translated]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a machine translation from Japanese. Please note that there may be unnatural expressions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Overview]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D command RPG, a typical command RPG with dungeon exploration as the main focus. It takes about 4 hours to reach the ending, and about 10 hours to enjoy all the elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380470/extras/15f36fb084cf00a280e960ebb31ddef9.avif?t=1748370148\" width=400 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Worldview]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of labyrinth appraisers exploring labyrinths around the world that have been created over thousands of years in a world ruled by rabbits instead of humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[system]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a light game that combines classic RPG and skill systems, where you create and explore original characters. It is designed so that even users who are not good at RPGs can reach the ending, but after clearing the game, there will be more labyrinths and exploration areas where tough enemies await, so please give it a try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Machine translated]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a machine translation from Japanese. Please note that there may be unnatural expressions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Overview]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D command RPG, a typical command RPG with dungeon exploration as the main focus. It takes about 4 hours to reach the ending, and about 10 hours to enjoy all the elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380470/extras/15f36fb084cf00a280e960ebb31ddef9.avif?t=1748370148\" width=400 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Worldview]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of labyrinth appraisers exploring labyrinths around the world that have been created over thousands of years in a world ruled by rabbits instead of humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[system]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a light game that combines classic RPG and skill systems, where you create and explore original characters. It is designed so that even users who are not good at RPGs can reach the ending, but after clearing the game, there will be more labyrinths and exploration areas where tough enemies await, so please give it a try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
